%% title: Account Lifecycle
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING_ACTIVATION : POST /api/v1/accounts\n(AccountOpened event)

    PENDING_ACTIVATION --> ACTIVE : KYC approved\n(kyc-service callback)
    PENDING_ACTIVATION --> CLOSED : KYC rejected\n(AccountClosed event)

    ACTIVE --> DORMANT : No activity\nfor configured period
    ACTIVE --> FROZEN : freeze()\ncourt order / AML hit\n(AccountFrozen event)

    DORMANT --> ACTIVE : Transaction occurs
    DORMANT --> FROZEN : freeze()
    DORMANT --> CLOSED : close()\n(AccountClosed event)

    FROZEN --> ACTIVE : unfreeze()\ncompliance clears hold\n(AccountUnfrozen event)
    FROZEN --> CLOSED : close() after\nregulatory resolution

    ACTIVE --> CLOSED : close()\n(AccountClosed event)

    CLOSED --> [*]

    note right of FROZEN
        All debit and credit
        operations rejected.
        Read-only access
        still permitted.
    end note

    note right of CLOSED
        data_retention_until
        set to +10 years
        (GDPR Art.17 / CNB)
    end note
